{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lHgj10fXf8f7dCBaUi9EwA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:19.469270+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lHgj10fXf8f7dCBaUi9EwA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/skg1s424C8g1KL9XDg5C2AFcjNCcPSLlQkyMiabX0SiaeavWQIBsIAiaEqXS0rhyTMjjOlUyk7TJttOybB1cVB382JeOQqR0JGWPELGAvcMUias/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8jxvWKTOEWDODnUCibrS7dKrSBo6O4iarj4MJvQaddgicZoC2IlNBkRYlGYxE9pFXzda4icBoGhptIZr8ZicLictv5jLwUuiaqNoOUPrw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/skg1s424C8gy9ibU85iaBsRDuAZTaDVN54m1rBibqFBWsWnMgBico2SOXWyV8Bh5WgdemIickRDd1DojvCfichIvnnTDIuSiaiaHWKHqLS4akUuc7jY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>    复旦大学法医学科历史悠久，底蕴深厚，是中国现代法医学教育的重要发源地之一。2025年，为更好地服务于全面依法治国重大战略，推进法医学一级学科发展和新医科建设，培养具备全球视野和创新能力的法医学及法庭科学拔尖人才，加速“第一个复旦”建设进程，复旦大学整合优势资源，成立法医学与法庭科学学院（以下简称学院）。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>    学院已构建完整的法医学本科、硕士、博士及博士后人才培养体系，入选国家级一流本科专业建设点。学科方向覆盖法医病理学、法医临床学、法医精神病学、法医物证学、法医毒物学及法庭科学等领域。学院坚持以人才培养为核心，注重学生基础理论与应用技能的综合训练，着力提升创新精神与实践能力。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>    学院目前作为独立招生单位（招生代码139），招收法医物证学、法医病理学、法医毒理与毒物分析、法医临床与精神病学、计算生物学等研究方向的法医学专业硕士和博士研究生。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8gXulR5TmTVVofib1ibEqLSnra20oBf47CZiaVM2yhibNmovDE5XBTiaY0GtDuJuGtcBWlUpsNv66mONibsAZNt4Z9Q2QsjuxNJafYxo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>01</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>报名时间</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8iaCgEibrzWMsI1WeAst3E7DLCMibYE34HSaJGG3ubDbeHDQAOA0ia6LTCNNYPKwM8HxrPl789Br0j0sUg7AGM1VHbGzbQLDAzBLss/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>    即日起至8月10日17:00。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>02</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>报名条件</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8iaicz62kbhxEwNEgrpCicRzcjQSgdl8MQrTElazyHCoGXGtBs9Dz5G6z07icQp3QOFAMmVzIOwAlBsDkBoicCOISpkibtzMeib9p0zTI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><ol><li><section><span>全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></section></li><li><section><span>学业成绩优秀，英语水平良好，预期可获得推荐免试资格；</span></section></li><li><section><span>具有较强的专业兴趣、学术创新潜力及实践应用能力，有志于从事法医学及相关交叉学科研究工作，遵守学术道德规范。</span></section></li></ol><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>03</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>报名材料</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8gfY9hwyfbnRXZHiaXVVia9E0ARZSls95ib8Za9cuIIMJYcibgZAN3FBeSgAEBNDuNUIWh2ia0zicsWROreicSJXKhL8gxsiaVFVOntOJ8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><ol><li><section><span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内；</span></section></li><li><section><span>本科阶段历年成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式；</span></section></li><li><section><span>具有代表性的获奖证书和学术科研成果（发表论文、出版物或专利等原创性工作成果的证明材料）；</span></section></li><li><section><span>外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></section></li><li><section><span>诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，填写相关信息并签名后上传）；</span></section></li><li><section><span>个人自述，包括个人简历、本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，对读研期间学习和未来职业规划的初步设想，1000字左右；</span></section></li><li><section><span>报考直博生的考生按报名系统要求提供推荐专家信息。</span></section></li></ol><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>04</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>报名方式</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8hjyia6QPHMibFkoLfsbibPRQSZ2ic8h3dOqWibZYpRWx9mkIkCMgkMRKIMYt5d47EwbICjdjQvXJUuAWeRgG92vh9STYL2DKyvbbCk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>    申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn），通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“推免生预报名”进行网上报名，无须寄送纸质材料。</span></section><section><span>    复旦大学法庭科学研究院目前挂靠学院招生，研究生导师的具体研究方向可参考学院主页（https://sfms.fudan.edu.cn/main.htm）和法庭科学研究院主页（https://ifs.fudan.edu.cn/）。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>05</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>考核时间及方式</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8iahibG0ybsnHe6JNVg9Rj8tfwawARn5qjpZiaKAevh3Qf7ia0xBia6KBTGzbNIqNASgQQVHEx8jVv8kmA4lrvQQiaJt4SShtNVUY0wo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><ol><li><section><span>考核时间：暂定8月下旬（将以邮件形式通知复试考生）；</span></section></li><li><section><span>考核地点：线下考核，复试考核具体安排将另行通知。</span></section></li></ol><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span>06</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>其他事项说明</span></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/skg1s424C8gvLUn5VuhH0ibhhwjc1I2aMSibYGGnRNibWvbpKP61y1TURWEq3nAicR6Lm7nYwOdsLzTkq4TJxHLLN9NHkjNzuZoMBmFBuZK7UQs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><ol><li><section><span>申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校；</span></section></li><li><section><span>申请人在录取当年入学报到前必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，否则录取资格无效；</span></section></li><li><section><span>凡有意报考我院2027级推免研究生的考生（含本校本科生），应申请参加本次预选拔活动。如果上级部门和学校关于推免生招生预选拔活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人；</span></section></li><li><section><span><span>咨询方式：</span><span><span>teaching_fy@fudan.edu.cn</span></span><span>。</span></span></section></li></ol><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>复旦大学法医学与法庭科学学院</span></section><section><span>2026年8月3日</span></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e70f0b9c878c722cb1e7a0b7f78d17d5e1f5b499d77927cab09abe749965ddb0","textLength":1265,"sourceSha256":"985f70a562acc53813cc2a1f04e677198ce959f51822a8d5334fd7753da42610","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-747603214d23341fa240","title":"2026年复旦大学法医学与法庭科学学院2027年推免生招生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:19.469270+00:00"}
